DESCRIPTION:✨She Owns It AVL✨\n✨ **She Owns It Meetup** ✨\n\n**Aug
 ust: A Night of Community & Connection**\n**We missed you! 💛**\nAfter o
 ur July break\, we’re so excited to get everyone back together.\nThis mo
 nth is all about reconnecting\, meeting new faces\, and enjoying a relaxed
  evening together.\n\nWe’ll start with our signature around-the-room int
 roductions\, introduce our new community directory\, and then simply hang 
 out\, catch up\, and enjoy great conversations with an incredible group of
  women!\n\nWhether it’s your first meetup or your tenth\, we’d love to
  see you.\n**Come grab a drink\, pull up a chair\, and join us!**\n\n✨ *
 *She Owns It AVL** gathers women ready to grow\, connect\, and belong. We 
 focus on life\, money\, mindset\, and wellness — creating space for real
  conversations\, meaningful relationships\, and lasting connection and ins
 piration.\n\n**We can’t wait to see you there!** 💫\nCome early to con
 nect! 5:30\n\nWe’re so grateful for everyone who signs up to join us! If
  your plans shift\, please update your RSVP—it helps us plan the evening
  and make space for other women who’d love to attend
